# Cursor Rules: WaPay Project

## Project Structure
- **ewallet/**: Django project config, settings, URLs, utils
- **user/**: Custom user model, registration, auth, signals
- **wallet/**: Wallet logic, transactions, fund/withdraw
- **referral/**: Referral codes, relationships, registration
- **static/**: CSS, JS, images
- **templates/**: HTML/email templates

## Environment & Config
- **Python:** 3.8.10
- **Framework:** Django 4.0.3
- **Dependency:** requirements.txt
- **Build:** build.sh, Procfile, runtime.txt
- **Settings:** ewallet/settings.py, .env (ignored)
- **Key Env Vars:** DEBUG, SECRET_KEY, FLWPUBK_TEST, FLWSECK_TEST, REDIRECT_DOMAIN
- **Secrets:** All keys/passwords via env vars only

## Entry Points
- **manage.py**: Django CLI
- **ewallet/wsgi.py**: WSGI
- **ewallet/asgi.py**: ASGI
- **Procfile**: Heroku (web: gunicorn)

## Main APIs & Routes
- **user/**: Auth, registration, password, activation
- **wallet/**: Dashboard, fund, send, receive, withdraw, transactions
- **referral/**: Referral dashboard, join via code

## Key Models
- **User** (custom, email-based)
- **Wallet** (balance, user, number)
- **TransactionHistory** (reference, amount, type, by/to)
- **PendingWithdrawal** (reference, user, status, amount)
- **ReferralCode** (user, code)
- **Referral** (referrer, referee)

## Extension Points
- **Signals:** User creation triggers wallet/referral/email
- **Payment:** Flutterwave via utils/env
- **Email:** Anymail, console, or SMTP
- **Settings:** All via env vars

## Test Coverage
- **user/tests.py, wallet/tests.py, referral/tests.py:** Stubs only (❌)
- **pytest.ini:** Configured for Django

